#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_WallaceStory"
msgid ""
"Ah, so you are {PLAYER}{KUN}?\n"
"I've heard tales of your exploits.\p"
"My name is WALLACE.\p"
"I was once the GYM LEADER of\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS, but something came up.\p"
"So now, I've entrusted my mentor JUAN\n"
"with the GYM's operation.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"GROUDON and KYOGRE, the two POKéMON\n"
"wreaking havoc here, are considered\l"
"to be super-ancient POKéMON.\p"
"But there aren't just two super-\n"
"ancient POKéMON.\p"
"There is one more somewhere.\p"
"Somewhere, there is a super-\n"
"ancient POKéMON named RAYQUAZA.\p"
"It's said that it was RAYQUAZA that\n"
"becalmed the two combatants in\l"
"the distant past.\p"
"But even I have no clue as to\n"
"RAYQUAZA's whereabouts…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你就是{PLAYER}{KUN}吗？\n"
"我听说过你的事迹。\p"
"我叫米可利。\p"
"我曾经是琉璃市的道馆馆主，\n"
"不过后来发生了一些事情。\p"
"所以现在我把道馆交给了\n"
"我的师父亚当来打理。\p"
"…… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"在这里肆虐的两只宝可梦\n"
"固拉多和盖欧卡，\l"
"被认为是超古代宝可梦。\p"
"不过，超古代宝可梦\n"
"并不只有它们两只。\p"
"还有一只在某个地方。\p"
"在某个地方，有一只名叫\n"
"烈空坐的超古代宝可梦。\p"
"据说在遥远的过去，\n"
"就是烈空坐平息了\l"
"这两只宝可梦的争斗。\p"
"可是就连我也不知道\n"
"烈空坐在哪里……$"

#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:86
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_WhereIsRayquaza"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: {PLAYER}{KUN}, do you perhaps\n"
"know where RAYQUAZA is now?\p"
"If you do, please tell me.$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"你知道烈空坐现在在哪里吗？\p"
"如果知道的话，请告诉我。$"

#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:91
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_ButWereInCaveOfOrigin"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: The CAVE OF ORIGIN?\p"
"But that's right here!\n"
"I need you to do better than that!\p"
"Please, I need you to think about\n"
"where RAYQUAZA might be right now.$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：觉醒祠堂？\p"
"可我们就在这里啊！\n"
"请你好好想一想！\p"
"拜托了，请想一想\n"
"烈空坐现在可能在哪里。$"

#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:98
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_OldLadyDidntMentionThat"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: MT. PYRE?\p"
"But when I met the old lady there\n"
"earlier, she made no mention of it.\p"
"I very much doubt that the old lady\n"
"would try to hide something from me…\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, could you think about this\n"
"more carefully for me?$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：送神山？\p"
"可是我之前在那里见到\n"
"那位老婆婆时，她什么都没提。\p"
"我不认为那位老婆婆\n"
"会对我隐瞒什么……\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"能请你再仔细想一想吗？$"

#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:107
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_CantYouRememberSomehow"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: Huh? You don't remember?\n"
"Hmm… That's a problem…\p"
"Can't you remember somehow?$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：咦？你不记得了？\n"
"嗯……这可麻烦了……\p"
"能不能想办法回忆起来呢？$"

#: data/maps/CaveOfOrigin_B1F/scripts.inc:112
msgctxt "CaveOfOrigin_B1F_Text_WellHeadToSkyPillar"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: The SKY PILLAR?\p"
"That's it!\n"
"It must be the SKY PILLAR!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, there's not a moment to lose!\n"
"We'll head to the SKY PILLAR right away!$"
msgstr ""
"米可利：天空柱？\p"
"对了！\n"
"一定是天空柱！\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，没有时间了！\n"
"我们马上去天空柱！$"
